      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am so sorry you are suffering through such guilt, and it is completely understandable given the pain of seeing your children's happiness compromised by your illness. Please try to remember that while they are navigating their own difficult path, your fight is ultimately rooted in love, even if you can't see it that way right now. Reaching out to a mental health professional could provide a safe space to process these overwhelming feelings so they don't consume your entire existence.",
